      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe this needs to be a world based toggle\nauto enable it on excisting worlds but give us the option (even if partaly obviscated) to disable it, cus vrchat has some worlds that need sub second reaction times like super vr ball\nand some worlds are all show no game",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "61a7a44dba2d262e2dbe831f",
